---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>SDT - Working Test</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
        color: white;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .hero {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 3rem;
        margin: 2rem 0;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      }
      .title {
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        background: linear-gradient(45deg, #fbbf24, #3b82f6);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
      }
      .subtitle {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      .equation {
        font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
        font-size: 2rem;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        padding: 1rem;
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin: 2rem 0;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      }
      .stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
        margin: 2rem 0;
      }
      .stat {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 10px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      }
      .stat-number {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #fbbf24;
      }
      .stat-label {
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(45deg, #fbbf24, #f59e0b);
        color: #0f172a;
        padding: 1rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 10px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 0.5rem;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
      }
      .button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero">
        <h1 class="title">Spatial Displacement Theory</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">A geometric alternative to quantum mechanics and general relativity</p>

        <div class="equation">
          ∇ · [K<sub>bulk</sub> ∇Δ(x)] = −κ ρ<sub>disp</sub>(x) (1 − E(x, n̂))
        </div>

        <p style="margin: 2rem 0; color: #cbd5e1;">
          One equation. All of physics. No quantum postulates. No curved spacetime.
        </p>

        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-number">53</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Orders of magnitude unified</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-number">&lt;1%</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Typical prediction error</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-number">0</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Free parameters</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <a href="/paths" class="button">Enter 3D Experience</a>
          <a href="/theory/overview" class="button" style="background: linear-gradient(45deg, #3b82f6, #1d4ed8);">Explore Theory</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 3rem; padding: 2rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 15px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
        <h2 style="color: #fbbf24; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🎉 Website is Working!</h2>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6;">
          The SDT website is successfully running. This demonstrates that the core Astro setup,
          styling, and basic functionality are working correctly. The complex 3D components
          and advanced features are being refined, but the foundation is solid.
        </p>
        <p style="color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 1rem;">
          Ready to explore the theory that unifies physics through geometry and pressure fields!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
